{"path":"language/attributes/fallthrough","title":"C attribute: fallthrough (since C23)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">C attribute:</span> fallthrough <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c23\">(since C23)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/language/attributes/fallthrough","section":"language","kind":"page","summary":"Indicates that the fall through from the previous case label is intentional and should not be diagnosed by a compiler that warns on fallthrough.","html":"<p>Indicates that the fall through from the previous case label is intentional and should not be diagnosed by a compiler that warns on fallthrough.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Syntax\">Syntax</h3>\n<table class=\"t-sdsc-begin\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" class=\"t-sdsc-sep\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-sdsc\">\n<td class=\"t-sdsc-nopad\"> <code><b>[[</b></code> <code><b>fallthrough</b></code> <code><b>]]</b></code><br><code><b>[[</b></code> <code><b>__fallthrough__</b></code> <code><b>]]</b></code>\n</td>\n<td class=\"t-sdsc-nopad\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"t-sdsc-nopad\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" class=\"t-sdsc-sep\">\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Explanation\">Explanation</h3>\n<p>May only be used in an <a href=\"/w/c/language/declarations\">attribute declaration</a> to create a <i>fallthrough declaration</i> (<code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span>fallthrough<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>).\n</p><p>A fallthrough declaration may only be used in a <a href=\"/w/c/language/switch\"><code>switch</code></a> statement, where the next block item (statement, declaration, or label) to be encounted is a statement with a <code>case</code> or <code>default</code> label for that switch statement.\n</p><p>Indicates that the fall through from the previous case label is intentional and should not be diagnosed by a compiler that warns on fallthrough.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"c\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdbool.h&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> g<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> h<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> i<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> n<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"kw1\">switch</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>n<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">case</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">case</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n      g<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n     <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span>fallthrough<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">case</span> <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"co1\">// no warning on fallthrough</span>\n      h<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">case</span> <span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"co1\">// compiler may warn on fallthrough</span>\n      <span class=\"kw1\">if</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>n <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n          i<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n          <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span>fallthrough<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// OK</span>\n      <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n      <span class=\"kw1\">else</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n          <span class=\"kw1\">return</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n      <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">case</span> <span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n      <span class=\"kw1\">while</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">false</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span>fallthrough<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// ill-formed: no subsequent case or default label</span>\n      <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">case</span> <span class=\"nu0\">6</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n      <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span>fallthrough<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// ill-formed: no subsequent case or default label</span>\n  <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/language/attributes/fallthrough\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>fallthrough</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Syntax","id":"Syntax"},{"depth":3,"text":"Explanation","id":"Explanation"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"language","title":"C language"},{"path":"language/attributes","title":"Attribute specifier sequence(since C23)"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"C attribute: fallthrough (since C23)","children":[{"label":"Syntax"},{"label":"Explanation","note":"May only be used in an attribute declaration to create a fallthrough declaration ([[fallthrough]];)."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also"}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":196,"codeBlockCount":1}
